#60000
"Before an Intricately Carved Stone Door"
"The vaulted ceiling of this wide cavern disappears into darkness and the
rough, uneven stone of the floor is littered with gravel and small shards of
stone.  A pair of beautifully engraved stone doors graces the west wall with
unexpected intricacy, a striking contrast to the crude cavern.  The richly
carved doors have been splashed with a red substance from which a wavering
circle has been drawn.
"
