#60018
"A Ruined Shrine - A Desecrated Altar"
"This raised dais is consumed by a pulsing, whirling gash of darkness that
extends all the way to the ceiling.  Sickly yellow light flashes and flickers
within its depths and a deep rumble throbs through the area near it.  Heat
emanates from the swirling mass of darkness, along with a fetid odor of decay
and the sickly-sweet scent of rotting meat.  Visible in the faint, pulsing
light are chunks of stone and splintered bones lying in a heap at the base of
the vortex, the shattered remains of the stone altar.
"
